WEBVTT

00:16:59.855 --> 00:17:03.237
ondje nalazimo ljudskost

00:17:03.237 --> 00:17:06.139
i tamo nalazimo istinu.

00:17:06.139 --> 00:17:08.253
Tony me pitao:

00:17:08.253 --> 00:17:12.138
''Jon, mogu li te počastiti pićem u kafiću?

00:17:12.138 --> 00:17:15.445
Želim ti se zahvaliti za sve što si učinio za mene.''

00:17:15.445 --> 00:17:20.501
Ali nisam otišao. Što biste vi učinili?

00:17:20.501 --> 00:17:21.811
Hvala vam.

00:17:21.811 --> 00:17:38.572
(Pljesak)